    "advantage": "Caffeine Tracker previews a proposed dose and time against a personal bedtime forecast before anything is logged",
    "competitive_context": "The category commonly offers drink logs and caffeine decay charts. This app centers the pre-log decision, dose-specific timing, and visible uncertainty range",
