        "claim": "The Planner compares the current bedtime forecast with a proposed dose before logging",
        "source": "capture/planner.png"
      },
      {
        "claim": "The Timeline shows caffeine intake and modeled bedtime values over time",
        "source": "capture/timeline.png"
      }
    ]
  },
